@format 1
@id merge.rename-group
@title Rename merge group
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Commit a new display and output name for one merge group.
@section I. UI
@tabs Merge
@flow TB
@related queue.create-merge-work

@alias group = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PGroup

[input] Group name editing begins <input>
- Replace the group heading with an editor @ group.PGroupEditStart(...)
> commit

[commit] Commit group name <process>
- Normalize and store the edited group name @ group.PGroupEditStart(...)
- Rebuild the group card heading @ group.PGroupRebuild(...)
> result

[result] Group renamed <output>
= The visible group and its future merge output use the committed name.
